dist
node_modules
.env

# Screenshots that end-to-end tests drop in the project root.
# Screenshots the e2e tests drop in the repo root.
#
# This used to be a list of filenames, one per test, and every new test added
# another stray PNG that nobody remembered to add — three of them (ferry,
# wasd, chat-history) were committed before anyone noticed. A rule that has to
# be extended by hand is a rule that will be out of date.
#
# Nothing real lives at the repo root as a .png: the game's art is under
# public/ and src/, and both are matched by the negations below.
/*.png
!public/*.png
!src/**/*.png

# Ad-hoc map renders from tools/render-map-full.mjs.
map-renders/
